cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use The Drake Display's model, code, or research library, please
  cite it using the metadata below. Contributors by track are listed in
  project/meta-docs/AUTHORS.md.
title: The Drake Display
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Louie
    family-names: Casinelli
repository-code: "https://github.com/aVOIDSTARch/drake-display"
abstract: >-
  A hazard-aware extension of the Drake equation in space and time: a
  log-odds habitability field over the Milky Way that combines positive and
  negative factors, each with a science-backing weight and a propagated
  confidence, driven by real stellar and exoplanet catalogs, with a time
  axis for evolving hazards.
keywords:
  - astrobiology
  - galactic habitable zone
  - Drake equation
  - habitability
  - astronomy
  - visualization
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.1.0
